<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="2ec6979e-3b1a-4d6e-9e92-b3b6eea4fb9f" version="7">
  <Properties>
    <Name>!Jarcast's Volcanoes for VP</Name>
    <Stability>Beta</Stability>
    <Teaser>Adds the Volcano as spawnable feature on the map.</Teaser>
    <Description>[ICON_BULLET]Compatible with any mapscript.
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Volcanoes yield +1 [ICON_FOOD] Food to adjacent tiles.
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Goddess of Nature belief applies also to Volcanoes;
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Existing and modded buildings, policies, traits involving mountains provide same bonuses to Volcanoes.
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET] 2 new World Wonder requiring a Volcano nearby: Pompeii ([ICON_RESEARCH] Archaeology, 1300 [ICON_PRODUCTION]), Tongariro National Park ([ICON_RESEARCH] Biology, 1550 [ICON_PRODUCTION])
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET] 2 new Buildings requiring a Volcano nearby: Obsidian Works ([ICON_RESEARCH] Construction, 85 [ICON_PRODUCTION], 1 GoldMaintenance), Volcano Observatory ([ICON_RESEARCH] Scientific Theory, 900 [ICON_PRODUCTION], 4 GoldMaintenance).
[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET] Krakatoa, Fuji, Kilimanjaro count as Volcanoes for building requirements. If More Wonders for VP is enabled also Mt. Paektu and Dallol.</Description>
    <Authors>Jarcast, ghost_toast</Authors>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <Homepage>http://https://forums.civfanatics.com/threads/volcanoes-for-vp.689150/</Homepage>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
    <MinCompatibleSaveVersion>0</MinCompatibleSaveVersion>
    <SupportsSinglePlayer>1</SupportsSinglePlayer>
    <SupportsMultiplayer>1</SupportsMultiplayer>
    <SupportsHotSeat>1</SupportsHotSeat>
    <SupportsMac>1</SupportsMac>
    <ReloadAudioSystem>1</ReloadAudioSystem>
    <ReloadLandmarkSystem>1</ReloadLandmarkSystem>
    <ReloadStrategicViewSystem>1</ReloadStrategicViewSystem>
    <ReloadUnitSystem>1</ReloadUnitSystem>
  </Properties>
